*> vybe-test: cobol/category_intrinsic_statistical/test_stat_range_neg
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_category_intrinsic_statistical.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION. PROGRAM-ID. T. DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
01 WS-VYBE-N PIC 9(9)V9(4) VALUE 0.
PROCEDURE DIVISION. DISPLAY FUNCTION RANGE(-2 -10).
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    COMPUTE WS-VYBE-N = FUNCTION RANGE(-2, -10)
    STRING WS-VYBE-N DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "0000000080000"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [0000000080000] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF. STOP RUN.

